# Space (live server): test-plan SP-12, bug B-29, the planet surfaces: GM `/wormhole SECTOR` from one surface sector
# to the next, each a sector whose Data\common\LANDnnnn.ini names a height map the data has (LAND2014's
# menorb2_256.pgm is missing; LAND3596 shares primus_256 with 3595 and land1930 asheroth1930_256 with 3679: one of
# each). Net-7 refuses /wormhole out of a sector that is not space unless the avatar's admin level is exactly 90
# (PlayerConnection.cpp Player::HandleWormholeRequest: "Invalid or Illegal Sector ID"; the store's avatar rows have 100),
# so run it with pldcheck.py's --admin-level 90 (set before the run, put back after it). A surface's launchpad is
# no way out after a wormhole: W targets a nav point beside the ship and no gate verb shows (CS9, 2026-11-26).
# Every surface's LandClass::Load_Assets (0x4691D0) computes its horizon tables (0x46E670, the normal step 0x46F120
# through Nearest_Normal 0x46F0A0) and writes them (Save_PLD 0x46ECF0) when pldcheck.py has deleted the instance's
# .pld files first (sp_land_pld.scn has the detail); a hop that fails stops the run with the earlier surfaces'
# files written. The surfaces in order:
#   2295 endriago_256 (Porvenir Mons Area)
#   1309 nostrandvor_256 (Nostrand Vor Planet)
#   3595 primus_256 (Praetorium Mons Area)
#   3679 asheroth1930_256 (Canopus II Planet)
#   4195 swooping_256 (Yasuragi Area)
#   2409 river4 (Gamma Sulani Planet)
#   1493 zwiehander_256 (Jagerstadt)
#   2290 RISCO_256 (GETCo Ruins)
#   pldcheck.py run --scenario sp_land_pld_all --admin-level 90 --instance NAME [--retail | --exe PATH] --runs N --out DIR
name: space: the planet surfaces by wormhole, the horizon tables written (SP-12, B-29)
timeout: 900
include _login_space
# endriago_256 (Porvenir Mons Area)
key 0x0D
wait-quiet proxy 0.5 within 10
text '/wormhole 2295'
key 0x0D
wait-event antprox 'sent SERVER_HANDOFF' within 60
move 1000,880
wait-event antprox 'received START_ACK$' within 180
wait-quiet proxy 1.5 within 60
alive 3
shot surface_2295
# nostrandvor_256 (Nostrand Vor Planet)
key 0x0D
wait-quiet proxy 0.5 within 10
text '/wormhole 1309'
key 0x0D
wait-event antprox 'sent SERVER_HANDOFF' within 60
